rooms_desc ({"You are standing on the front porch of Casanova and Amberly's house.It's a fully restored, two story Victorian farmhouse surroundedby immaculate lawn and majestic shade trees.To the northeast you can see a green, roomy pasture bordered by miles ofwhite fencing where Amberly's horses are grazing contentedly.","Entering the house, you find yourself in the hallway.A long curving staircase leads up the second floor. As you are being helpedout of your coat by your attentive host, you look around and notice thateverything is both stylish and practical. You feel that no one would ever ask you not to touch something here. Already you can feel yourself relaxingand feeling at home.","A large room with a gigantic heart shaped swimming pool.Damp air rises from the pool and it looks warm and inviting.There is a water slide in the south end of the pool.In the north end you can see a tower with three diving boards.","A dazzling dining room.In the centre of the room is a long table.Around it you can see wabout 50 chairs.The room is lighted with magnificent crystal chandeliers.","A large library filled with thousands of books and magazines.Book shelves stretch several metres into the air.This library houses Casanova world famous comics collection.You can also find a collection of stamps and coins in here.",0,0,0,0,0,})
